Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.29,0:00:07.40,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Everyone in our class...{The talk about Yuuki who transferrezd into our class,}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.94,0:00:12.64,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}had been talking about Yuuki who had recently transferred in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.84,0:00:16.81,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Wow! {whispering} {I think 'wow' would be better fit in this context. -Xien}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.89,0:00:28.55,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Coming, coming.{Going, going.}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.62,0:00:35.98,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Please step out, Miss.{Please go out, Miss.}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.72,0:00:52.23,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Miss, here is your bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.88,0:00:55.99,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Miss, your indoor shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.13,0:01:00.37,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Have a good day!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.71,0:02:47.51,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Yuuki-san. What should I call you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.88,0:02:51.47,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yuuki-san? Or Nona-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.47,0:02:54.70,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You just transferred so if you have any questions, please don't hesitate to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.37,0:02:59.24,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Anything about club activities...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.24,0:03:01.41,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Or the rank of the teacher's popularity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.35,0:03:07.79,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Please excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.79,0:03:12.13,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I am currently studying a very significant theorem right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.53,0:03:25.92,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Wow!{Wah!}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.92,0:03:27.25,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.40,0:03:33.31,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Amazing! {OMFG!}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.31,0:03:35.74,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru is like a completely different person when he's in the water. {Haru is like a different person when in water} {STW:Haru is like a COMPLETELY different person when in water}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.32,0:03:38.54,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Although he usually just dazes around.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.64,0:04:00.24,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Tsuwabuki-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.80,0:04:04.18,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Okay! {Yeah!(?)}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.81,0:04:09.39,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Instead of the PE teacher, who's currently on break, I'll be in charge of the class.{Gamefish: former line "In place of the PE teacher on break, I'll be in charge of the class."}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.12,0:04:12.53,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, that was an excellent time there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.16,0:04:14.27,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,In fact, it's the best.{Uh, I think it needs rewording.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.30,0:04:20.38,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,So... why isn't Yuuki-san swimming?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.09,0:04:23.74,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Why read when you can swim?{Why read when it's the time for swimming?}{Why read when you can swim? -Xien}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.53,0:04:26.63,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe she can't swim...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.56,0:04:31.93,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Akihime-san, it's your turn next.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.82,0:04:39.58,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sensei, Sumomo can't really swim. {have problem with water, have phobia with water} {STW:Why would she have a phobia if she is already in the water? Maybe she is saying that Sumomo can't swim}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.79,0:04:49.27,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, Tsuwabuki-kun, please help teach Akihime-san how to swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.55,0:04:50.73,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.25,0:04:51.77,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.31,0:04:54.36,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You're both in the Gardening Club, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.36,0:04:56.67,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,So you can help her with some special training. {STW: Just give her some special swimming training/special training}{Go help her with some special training}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.67,0:04:57.69,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Special training?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.94,0:05:07.55,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, how about you, Yuuki-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.28,0:05:11.70,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,If you are bad with water, why don't you take the special training with Sumomo-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.05,0:05:15.08,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have anything that I'm bad at though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.08,0:05:18.16,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,There is no such thing as being bad with water. {STW: There is no such thing as being bad with water}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.74,0:05:51.60,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Amazing, Yuuki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.60,0:05:53.93,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,So she's good in athletics too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.93,0:05:56.81,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Good style and body!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.81,0:05:58.53,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,All the guys will go head over heels.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.90,0:06:15.89,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.35,0:06:20.98,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.16,0:06:34.28,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.28,0:06:35.04,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.79,0:06:37.61,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.22,0:06:45.35,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Hey Haru, why are you blushing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.65,0:06:46.93,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,N-No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.35,0:06:48.88,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not blushing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.88,0:06:50.88,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You're blushing. You... {What?}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.37,0:06:59.71,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Ugh! It's hot and humid!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.71,0:07:02.61,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Why is it so hot and humid for dolls?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.57,0:07:09.87,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't I have the courage...?{Why do I lack courage...?}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.22,0:07:16.12,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm bad with water.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.81,0:07:19.87,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe it's because of all the things that happened when I was little.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.47,0:07:25.98,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Doggy, doggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.33,0:07:35.88,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Fishy, fishy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.95,0:07:41.31,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I can't even put my face inside the pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.31,0:07:44.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry about things like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.04,0:07:57.96,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The star drop!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.95,0:08:11.83,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Nako-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.83,0:08:13.36,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I saw the light, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.77,0:08:15.68,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.79,0:08:22.06,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's inside the pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.93,0:08:23.90,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.90,0:08:25.98,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Why is it so deep?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.98,0:08:27.18,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I can't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.24,0:08:32.23,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo, are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.23,0:08:33.22,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.04,0:08:35.76,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You don't have to do this...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.47,0:08:38.57,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine. I'll try...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.90,0:09:02.36,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,W-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.41,0:09:06.56,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Nako-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.20,0:09:14.70,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You look pathetic, Prima Plam.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.33,0:09:26.66,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Who is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.27,0:09:30.36,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Umm... Aspalas-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.36,0:09:36.40,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,No! I am Prima Aspalas, which means I'm Saint Aspalas' Prima.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.63,0:09:38.85,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Saint Aspalas?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.85,0:09:40.05,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,So it's Aspalas-san, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.05,0:09:41.21,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.16,0:09:45.85,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,So you've come to interfere with Sumomo again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.05,0:09:49.70,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Interfere? That's outrageous! {No way!}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.03,0:09:52.62,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm here to give you my guidance!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.02,0:09:54.62,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,G-Guidance?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.03,0:09:57.88,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I want to have a fair fight with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.61,0:10:00.85,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That's why I want you to become stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.37,0:10:03.14,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Listen and watch carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.14,0:10:07.60,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,When the star drop is underwater, this magic will be the most effective. {When capturing the star drop underwater, bla bla}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.96,0:10:10.99,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs28\fnCalligraph421 BT\3c&H436398&}Rimu Comiti Aqua!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.43,0:10:22.55,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,W-What is that, Aspalas-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.46,0:10:25.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Arthur. {STW: Arthur?}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.83,0:10:27.19,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,R-Right away, Miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.36,0:10:36.39,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,This is a spell that repels water.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.93,0:10:39.79,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,With this, you can't get wet and you can breathe underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.12,0:10:42.52,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,So if I chant those words...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.16,0:10:45.94,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You can go underwater and capture the star drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.51,0:10:50.38,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,However, a person who is scared of water will be unable to use this magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.38,0:10:53.51,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Are you surprised?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.15,0:10:55.94,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Don't tell me you're afraid of water?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.48,0:10:57.42,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.83,0:11:01.44,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,So you really are afraid of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.84,0:11:06.15,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yuuki-san, how good are your eyes?{Yuuki-san, do you have bad or good eyesight? [How good are your eyes?]}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.15,0:11:09.14,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Or does it improve when you're in those clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.46,0:11:15.99,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Did you just call me Yuuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.77,0:11:19.32,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Well, those {\i1}are{\i0} Yuuki-san's glasses.{Well that's Yuuki-san's glasses.}{spectacle go British style!! :P} {I prefer the ones without frame} {STW: Well they are Yuuki-san's glasses}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.11,0:11:23.28,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yuuki-san is Aspalas-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.39,0:11:50.35,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Listen, there is another world which coexists with our own. {STW: There is another world which coexists with our own}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.35,0:11:55.14,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,In that world Figurare, there are two academies.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.53,0:12:02.47,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The academies' names are Plam Cloris and Saint Aspalas.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.44,0:12:07.78,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Both academies train Stellar Spinears to gather the star drops. {STW: Academies}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.55,0:12:14.45,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Every year, the choosing of each academies' best student as their representative...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.21,0:12:20.51,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,and sending them to this world to compete for the star drops has become a tradition. {can be better sentence but I wanted to include all that was said}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.62,0:12:23.93,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Competition for the star drops?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.83,0:12:27.30,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It was meant to help improve both academies.{It was aimed to improve both academies.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.01,0:12:33.29,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,And whoever manages{STW: Manages} to gather all seven star drops will be declared the winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.91,0:12:34.73,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,So that means... {STW: Means}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.56,0:12:41.85,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I am Saint Aspalas' representative, Prima Aspalas.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.37,0:12:50.44,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Miss is such an excellent student that many predict that Saint Aspalas will surely win this year. {STW: Miss is such an excellent student that many predicted that Saint Aspalas will surely win this year.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.43,0:12:57.91,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But, then... what happened to the other academy's representative?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.53,0:13:02.75,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, that girl came here once but had to go back due to sudden illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.27,0:13:06.18,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That's why another representative was chosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.50,0:13:08.36,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You're talking about me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.40,0:13:12.18,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Right. The ring chose you.{Right, the ring chose you.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.96,0:13:18.93,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Mysteriously, the ring chose a normal girl who doesn't know anything about the star drops.{Reword 'mysteriously}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.12,0:13:27.09,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,So in other words, Sumomo is already participating in the two academies' competition?{What? -Xien}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.09,0:13:28.62,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That's basically what it's become.{That's the jist of it.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.62,0:13:32.65,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Incidentally, it just so happened that there was someone who needed the star drops as well.{Well, incidently there is someone who needed the star drops as well.}{coincidentally?}{should be incidently. he is saying that "it just happen someone needed bla bla as well" -Oneil}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.65,0:13:34.25,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Incidentally, huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.77,0:13:40.55,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You will need all seven star drops to save him too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.31,0:13:43.21,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I won't approve of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.74,0:13:47.51,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Academy student or not, anyone can chant first rate magic. {STW: Remove the "a"}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.12,0:13:51.33,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You probably can't even do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.33,0:13:54.04,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I will never approve of competing with someone like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.53,0:13:56.78,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Rimu Comiti Aqua...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.39,0:14:00.86,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The magic spell that repels water should not be in your Recipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.85,0:14:05.13,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Why? Because you're afraid of water!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.32,0:14:11.09,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Come with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.86,0:14:19.80,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.34,0:14:23.07,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sensei...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.22,0:14:24.70,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.70,0:14:27.98,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,She is Saint Aspalas' representative who holds high standards.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.69,0:14:31.10,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,She won't hurt people randomly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.25,0:14:32.77,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.04,0:14:40.41,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,A Stellar Spinear who is afraid of water will never make any progress.{A Stellar Spinear who is afraid of water will not go anywhere.}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.14,0:14:48.07,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs28\fnCalligraph421 BT\3c&H436398&}Pramu Victor!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.62,0:14:58.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, that is excellent, Miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.60,0:15:01.04,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You have twenty-four hours left.{There will be twenty four hours left.}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.63,0:15:04.56,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,After that, the star drop will be sealed inside the pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.14,0:15:09.84,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Try and capture the star drop within that time.{Try and capture the star drop within twenty-four hours.}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.55,0:15:18.59,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,If you can't then you'll never be able to gather all seven star drops, Prima Plam.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.94,0:15:25.24,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs28\fnCalligraph421 BT\3c&H436398&}Aradi Fumei!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.51,0:15:35.26,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.68,0:15:40.73,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I have to gather the star drops...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.73,0:15:42.43,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I have to gather all seven of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.73,0:15:49.45,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Otherwise, Yuki-chan won't be able to go home. {STW: won't}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.51,0:15:55.19,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I can't keep on always being afraid of water. {STW: I shouldn't continue being afraid of water}{I can't be afraid of water forever.}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.18,0:15:59.11,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I shouldn't disappoint Yuuki.{Gamefish: I think Sumomo is talking about Yuuki (Aspalas) here, instead of Yuki-chan (Tsuwabaki). Reason: when she speaks about Tsuwabaki-sheep-form, she always says "Yuki-chan". There's no "-chan" being said here.}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.96,0:16:19.34,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Now, in the beginning you should use a kickboard.{Now, in the beginning you should use a swimming board.}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.50,0:16:21.06,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.06,0:16:22.12,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Just relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.97,0:16:23.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.96,0:16:26.25,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Now, try lifting your feet off of the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.89,0:16:41.30,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Slowly move your body forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.16,0:16:48.90,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.33,0:16:51.63,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,A-Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.96,0:17:00.52,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Relax and breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.51,0:17:10.78,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, you don't have to force yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.04,0:17:13.89,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.89,0:17:15.47,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,One more time, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.07,0:17:20.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}This is the first time I've seen Akihime with this expression.{First time seeing Akihime with this expression.}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.33,0:17:36.20,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.33,0:17:36.20,Nanatsuiro[Default2],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.20,0:17:37.57,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm alright, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.39,0:17:39.05,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Akihime...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.26,0:17:50.09,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Do your best!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.01,0:17:52.99,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Do your best, Akihime!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.79,0:18:02.59,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You did your best, until your body felt this cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.94,0:18:09.66,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,There's no need to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.17,0:18:13.65,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It will be fine. You will overcome your fear in no time. {STW: You will conquer your fear in no time}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.08,0:18:16.87,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.21,0:18:25.63,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I think that Akihime really... is very courageous.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.57,0:18:32.21,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.61,0:18:33.81,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Tsuwabuki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.99,0:18:39.17,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Today... Today... T-Thank...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.68,0:18:43.13,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I-I'm sorry! I'll see you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.57,0:19:04.41,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.23,0:19:15.08,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry... Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.17,0:19:17.51,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.45,0:19:23.64,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's alright. If you can't do it today, in time you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.66,0:19:26.17,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Even with the gathering of the the star drops too... {STW: Does this even make sense combined with the last sentence?} {No.}{make more sense now? -Oneil}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.62,0:19:31.45,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.06,0:19:35.84,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Because Yuki-chan came to me, many great things have happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.38,0:19:38.88,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,And I... And I...{I, I...}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.11,0:19:41.90,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I think that Akihime really... is very courageous.{really courageous... I think...}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.22,0:19:45.36,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Thank you, Tsuwabuki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.71,0:19:48.17,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Watch me, Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.57,0:20:00.08,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs28\fnCalligraph421 BT\3c&H985443&}Ruuche Ruvi Avis
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.17,0:20:15.98,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The characters!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.72,0:20:26.97,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Err... Rimu...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.05,0:20:32.37,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs28\fnCalligraph421 BT\3c&H985443&}Rimu Comiti Aqua!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.03,0:20:48.93,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Nako-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.50,0:20:51.30,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.50,0:21:02.81,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I can really breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.81,0:21:03.45,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.58,0:21:07.39,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,And I can move freely too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.39,0:21:08.83,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's like flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.83,0:21:10.45,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,This is amazing, Sumomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.45,0:21:11.30,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Let's try this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.73,0:21:21.84,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It seems bottomless, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.52,0:21:26.49,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.28,0:21:37.34,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.34,0:21:37.74,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.74,0:21:41.51,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs28\fnCalligraph421 BT\3c&H985443&}Puruvu Radi!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.17,0:22:05.80,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}That girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.35,0:22:10.68,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}A chant she heard only once; she mastered it on her first attempt. {try} {STW: She mastered it on her first attempt}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.77,0:22:15.94,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Even for a student in the academy, it takes at least a week to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.67,0:22:17.52,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Also, using it at that level...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.20,0:22:22.90,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I had doubts about Arthur's report, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.26,0:22:33.14,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The shy and timid Akihime successfully overcame her fear of water. {afraid of water...}{ Hydrophobia}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.39,0:22:36.53,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}That alone took a lot of courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.97,0:22:40.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}While being together with her as Yuki-chan,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.13,0:22:44.03,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I felt something changing inside of me along with her.{I felt something inside me change with her.}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.16,0:22:47.05,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}And... I started to become confused.{I'm getting confused.}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.44,0:24:22.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The summer season fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.00,0:24:22.87,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Making curry!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.87,0:24:23.84,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Test of courage!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.84,0:24:24.92,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Hot spring!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.92,0:24:25.70,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Pillow fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.70,0:24:26.24,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,And also,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.24,0:24:28.41,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Confessing to someone you like at night!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.41,0:24:29.47,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Who, who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.47,0:24:31.01,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Who do you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.01,0:24:31.88,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.88,0:24:34.07,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Boys are not allowed to enter!
